{"evidence":["`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:47-57` computes CO2 K_LA by calling `compute_o2_kla(state)`, applying the same Euler cap the O2 path uses, and then scaling by `0.91`, which preserves the intended shared-basis CO2/O2 transfer ratio even when raw O2 K_LA exceeds the cap.","`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:566-603` computes atmospheric CO2 exchange from carbonate-solved aqueous CO2 versus Henry-law equilibrium and immediately re-resolves carbonate state after DIC changes, so aeration-driven stripping feeds through to bicarbonate and pH in the same hourly chemistry step.","`crates/tank_core/tests/co2_exchange.rs:473-515` now exercises the real `compute_co2_kla()` path and asserts the 0.91 ratio both below the cap and when raw O2 K_LA is above 1.0, so the regression test would catch the prior cap-ordering bug.","`crates/tank_core/tests/concentration_helpers.rs:41-46` now derives GH expectations from the same molar-mass ratios used by `crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs:10-18` and `crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs:175-181`, which makes the repaired full-package test match library behavior instead of rounded coefficients.","`cargo test -q -p tank_core --test co2_exchange` passed (12/12), `cargo test -q -p tank_core --test concentration_helpers` passed (10/10), `cargo test -q -p tank_core` passed across the full `tank_core` package, and `cargo clippy -q -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` plus `cargo fmt --check -p tank_core` both passed in the current checkout."],"findings_or_gaps":["No correctness, regression, or completeness issues were found in the current checkout for this task or the follow-on concentration-helper test repair."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"}